# Normalize line endings so a Windows checkout does not show phantom diffs.
# Without this, regenerating the published tree reports every file as changed
# while the content is byte-identical (measured 2026-08-30: 42 files "changed",
# 0 with a real difference).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary-ish assets git should never touch
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
*.tgz binary
